    <name>cattle_pasture_historical_loss</name>
    <description>Manual reference AOI, not a surveyed farm boundary. Mapped first forest conversion before 2021. It must not be dated after the cutoff solely because current imagery is nonforest; subsequent regrowth/reclearing is not ruled out by a first-loss-year layer. PLUTo sample 230024407 (pasture); https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17831353, CC-BY-4.0. Geometry derived from European Commission JRC TMF v1_1982_2025. See manifest.json and README.md for source dates, attribution and limitations.</description>
